==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 7 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Rayquaza ex Drop Event]], which ran from April 30 to May 13, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Rayquaza|106}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
* '''Spiral Rush''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Deoxys|Rayquaza ☆|107}} from the {{TCG|EX Deoxys}} expansion.
* This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl}}.

